# Intentionally not a certificate.
#
# Set RESTORE_DRILL_EXECUTOR_SSLROOTCERT_SOURCE_FILE to a managed, noncredential
# CA-root PEM before using RESTORE_DRILL_EXECUTOR_SSLMODE=verify-ca or
# RESTORE_DRILL_EXECUTOR_SSLMODE=verify-full. The executor validates this file
# at configuration load and fails closed when this placeholder is still mounted.
